  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "三条实写路径",
      "items": [
        "projects 路由 → insert_project / list_projects。id 形如 proj_<uuid>。",
        "create_version：ArtifactStore 写文件并算 sha256，再 INSERT skill_versions，更新 current_version_id。",
        "emit：trace_events.payload 存整条 TraceEvent；lifespan 的 subscriber 把它 send_json 给已连接的 WS。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "虚线的含义",
      "items": [
        "Web→API：浏览器没有客户端。CORS allow_origins 默认 http://localhost:5173。",
        "API→Registry：路由表只有 /health、/api/events、/api/projects。",
        "Gateway→LLM：model_adapter=fake 时不发 HTTP。默认 model_base_url 是 127.0.0.1:8080/v1，与 ops-lab 容器内端口号相同、不是同一监听。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "状态机约束",
      "items": [
        "PipelineState 与 SkillVersionStatus 两张表，互不混用。Pipeline 还没有运行时调用方。",
        "版本：DRAFT→CANDIDATE|REJECTED，CANDIDATE→VALIDATED|REJECTED，VALIDATED→APPROVED|REJECTED，APPROVED→PUBLISHED。跳步抛 InvalidStateTransition。",
        "转移函数本身允许最终到 PUBLISHED；仓库里还没有任何自动调用它的路径。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "表与适配器",
      "items": [
        "已有写入：projects、skills、skill_versions、trace_events。",
        "仅 schema：source_documents、chunks、knowledge_units、eval_cases、evaluation_runs。",
        "structured 失败时把校验错误追加进 messages，最多 structured_output_max_retries（默认 3）。",
        "Phase 3 两个执行面：phase3-runtime.html。调用顺序：control-plane-calls.html。"
      ]
    }
  ]
